Form component, annotating the zod schema with useful comments, and replacing enums with constants in line with best practices.","authorName":"Dennis Kigen","authorEmail":"kigen.work@gmail.com"},{"hash":"548f8afcf734e0c7fbb87d6345e2490a528994cf","date":"2025-02-14T18:34:29+05:30","message":"(feat) O3-4342: Split allergy form fields (#2232)","refs":"","body":"* added openmrs datepicker\n\n* Improve error handling for comments in AllergyForm\n\n* replace openmrsDatePicker with cabon design datepicker\n\n* remove the onsetDate and kept only the comments\n\n* Correct label text casing for comments field in allergy form\n\n* updated en.json\n\n* updated en.json\n\n* fixup\n\n* removed onset date text in allergies.spec.ts\n\n* Rename 'comment' to 'comments' in allergy form schema and related logic\n\n* Refactor allergy form styling and improve form submission logic\n\n- Adds a loading state to the submit button when the form is being submitted\n- Fixes the form height to ensure the action buttons are pinned to the bottom of the form\n- Changes the `comments` form field name back to `comment` to match the backend data model\n- Fixes an issue where the allergic reactions from an existing allergy record were not correctly loaded into the form\nwhen editing.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Dennis Kigen <kigen.work@gmail.com>","authorName":"praneeth","authorEmail":"141117659+Muppasanipraneeth@users.noreply.github.com"},{"hash":"5cab0737fca2e515f24eb53dbf1d2639519c0a26","date":"2025-01-28T18:47:28+05:30","message":"(fix) O3-4403: Unable to record allergy in non-English locale (#2215)","refs":"","body":"* (fix) Unable to record allergy in non-English locale\r\n\r\n* Remove index","authorName":"Jayasanka Weerasinghe","authorEmail":"33048395+jayasanka-sack@users.noreply.github.com"},{"hash":"f4566eef78a1864e280d9ca3f99b7505ae7d793c","date":"2024-07-09T14:33:59+03:00","message":"(fix) O3-3469: Fix allergy data tile display for severe allergies (#1897)","refs":"","body":"(fix) Fix allergy data tile display for severe allergies","authorName":"Dennis Kigen","authorEmail":"kigen.work@gmail.com"},{"hash":"d2a3c8afc7288a5d57a61ce2a469b7c16a2a8cfb","date":"2024-03-28T22:07:06+03:00","message":"(test) O3-3000: Add E2E tests for editing and deleting an allergy (#1761)","refs":"","body":"(test) O3-3OOO: Add E2E tests for editing and deleting an allergy","authorName":"Daud Kakumirizi","authorEmail":"dkakumirizii@gmail.com"},{"hash":"e438002a9b2012f6025a629c6b03a9ec1f65399f","date":"2024-03-07T22:31:31+03:00","message":"(feat) Add functionality to allow deleting and editing an allergy (#1703)","refs":"","body":"* Add functionality to allow deleting and editing an allergy\r\n\r\n(feat) O3-2760: Add a `closeWorkspaceWithSavedChanges` function to the workspace API (#1689)\r\n\r\n* Added new function 'closeWorkspaceWithSavedChanges' to close workspace after form is saved\r\n\r\n* Passing 'closeWorkspaceWithSavedChanges' as workspace props\r\n\r\n(docs) Amend steps for updating core libraries in README (#1690)\r\n\r\n(chore) Bump @openmrs/ngx-formentry (#1684)\r\n\r\n(fix) O3 2804: Reuse the ResponsiveWrapper component from esm-framework (#1673)\r\n\r\n* (feat) Reuse ResponsiveWrapper component from esm-framework\r\n\r\n* feat: Added Layer in visit-notes-form\r\n\r\n* Fix styleguide imports by bumping both openmrs tooling and framework\r\n\r\n* Misc fixes\r\n\r\n---------\r\n\r\nCo-authored-by: Dennis Kigen <kigen.work@gmail.com>\r\n\r\n(refactor) O3-2815: Replace usages of `/ws/rest/v1` with `restBaseUrl` (#1661)\r\n\r\n* (Refactor)O3-2815: Replace usages of '/ws/rest/v1' with restBaseUrl\r\n\r\n* Fixup\r\n\r\n---------\r\n\r\nCo-authored-by: jwnasambu <wamalwa1844.com>\r\nCo-authored-by: Dennis Kigen <kigen.work@gmail.com>\r\n\r\n(feat) Add ability to cancel orders (#1640)\r\n\r\n* (feat) cancel order\r\n\r\n* clean up\r\n\r\n* pr changes, reload fixes and clean up\r\n\r\n* translations\r\n\r\n* wip cancel order via action\r\n\r\n* mutate orders on cancel\r\n\r\n* order mutations and pr comments\r\n\r\n* fixes to labs\r\n\r\n* button text change\r\n\r\n* Fixup\r\n\r\n* More tweaks\r\n\r\n---------\r\n\r\nCo-authored-by: Dennis Kigen <kigen.work@gmail.com>\r\n\r\n(chore) Add generic slot to Visit Form (#1688)\r\n\r\n* (chore) Add billing slot to Start Visit Form\r\n\r\n* Add generic visit attribute slot\r\n\r\n* remove slot from config\r\n\r\n---------\r\n\r\nCo-authored-by: CynthiaKamau <cynthiakamau54@gmail.com>\r\n\r\n(chore) Bump Angular form engine (#1694)\r\n\r\n(feat) Makes orders widget expandable and adds detailed order view (#1696)\r\n\r\n* (feat) Expandable orders widget\r\n\r\n* adds order item cards when expanded\r\n\r\n* changes button to tooltip\r\n\r\n(fix) O3-2629: Submit button on Allergy Form remains disabled when filling allergen and severity before reactions (#1699)\r\n\r\nfix the allergy reaction dependency\r\n\r\n(feat) Hide bottom navigation on tablets and phones when workspace is active (#1695)\r\n\r\n(feat) Relocate Load More button in visits section (#1702)\r\n\r\n(chore) Relocate Load More button in visits section\r\n\r\nadd closeWorkspaceWithSavedChanges argument to Allergy form\r\n\r\nparameterised allergy reaction should be checked correctly\r\n\r\nmaintain non-coded allergen array\r\n\r\nremove test\r\n\r\n(chore) Prettier should only list files that don't formatting config\r\n\r\n(feat) Add config to handle bill submission in start visit form (#1700)\r\n\r\nUpgrade peter-evans/create-pull-request\r\n\r\nSee https://github.com/peter-evans/create-pull-request/issues/2790\r\n\r\n(chore) Update translations from Transifex (#1683)\r\n\r\nadd test\r\n\r\nfix added test\r\n\r\n* clean deletePatientAllergy function\r\n\r\n* Update packages/esm-patient-allergies-app/src/allergies/allergies-form/allergy-form.component.tsx\r\n\r\nCo-authored-by: Dennis Kigen <kigen.work@gmail.com>\r\n\r\n* Update packages/esm-patient-allergies-app/src/allergies/allergies-form/allergy-form.test.tsx\r\n\r\nCo-author